# Architecture

Write architecture docs to `docs/architecture/<feature>.md`.

## Document structure

```markdown
# <Feature> Architecture

## Overview
High-level approach and key decisions.

## API Contracts
Endpoints, request/response shapes (link to packages/shared types).

## Data Model
Prisma models and relationships.

## Module Boundaries
NestJS modules and Next.js feature folders affected.

## Async Jobs
BullMQ queue names, job payloads, retry policy.

## Caching
Redis keys, TTL, invalidation strategy.

## ADRs
| Decision | Choice | Rationale |
```

## Conventions

- Default to REST; document OpenAPI paths when added.
- Shared types/DTOs/Zod schemas go in `packages/shared` before parallel FE/BE work.
- One NestJS module per domain (`*.module.ts`, `*.controller.ts`, `*.service.ts`).
- Record significant trade-offs as ADR rows, not inline debate.
